{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3122220/extras/lava.gif?t=1748018407\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mr Figs is a challenging top-down action puzzler where you play as Mr Figs - an adorable squid-like humanoid.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Armed with as many bombs as you can carry. Blast,\u00a0manoeuvre and puzzle your way out of countless levels and areas trying to reach the depths below.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">120+ levels across 4 different areas to explore</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Boss fights</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Puzzles and &quot;aha!&quot; moments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Secret challenge rooms (shh don't tell anyone)</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Puzzle yourself out of tricky situations</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3122220/extras/output_final_optimized.gif?t=1748018407\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Blow up things</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3122220/extras/bombgrassgif.gif?t=1748018407\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">And get used to danger</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3122220/extras/first-area-running.gif?t=1748018407\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3122220?t=1748018407","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3122220?t=1748018407","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3122220/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748018407","capsule_imagev5":